  "description": "Atteliora is an elegant modern serif font crafted to bring sophistication, luxury, and timeless beauty to every design. Featuring graceful high-contrast letterforms, stylish ligatures, and carefully designed alternate characters, Atteliora delivers a refined editorial aesthetic that is perfect for premium branding and creative projects.\nInspired by classic fashion typography with a contemporary twist, Atteliora creates stunning visual harmony for logos, magazine headlines, cosmetic packaging, wedding invitations, social media graphics, book covers, luxury websites, and boutique branding. Every character has been meticulously designed to ensure exceptional readability while maintaining an artistic and distinctive personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Atteliora is an elegant modern serif font crafted to bring sophistication, luxury, and timeless beauty to every design. Featuring graceful high-contrast letterforms, stylish ligatures, and carefully designed alternate characters, Atteliora delivers a refined editorial aesthetic that is perfect for premium branding and creative projects.<br>\nInspired by classic fashion typography with a contemporary twist, Atteliora creates stunning visual harmony for logos, magazine headlines, cosmetic packaging, wedding invitations, social media graphics, book covers, luxury websites, and boutique branding. Every character has been meticulously designed to ensure exceptional readability while maintaining an artistic and distinctive personality.</p>",
